If you use or adapt a prompt from this repository, we ask that you credit the original author(s):

In your project README or documentation: Include a brief acknowledgment (e.g., "Based on [Prompt Name] by [Author Name]")
In code/prompt files: Add a comment referencing the original source and author
For significant modifications: You can mark it as "Inspired by [original]" or "Adapted from [original]"

Example:
